 "text": "Hey there, how are you? That' a common feeling. Taking breaks actually helps you get more done in the long run. Think of it like a car. You'd never drive without stops, and yet a lot of us treat our focus during the day like that. Walk outside, make a cup of coffee, do something mindless for five minutes. It lets your brain rest without losing your place. Definitely not. Your phone is the worst break of all. And if you' still feeling tired, a short, quiet nap is a wonderful thing.",
